  <item>
    <title>EP06《卡拉玛左夫兄弟》：NF人精神诊断书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d9d437bfd7110df48b8a8c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d9d437bfd7110df48b8a8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Sep 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好癫好喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>年度最爱的书没有之一，看爽了，给陀翁举杯致谢 (｀∀´)Ψ&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目就围绕“爱”这个主题来唠一唠吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【1】老卡拉玛左夫的错误示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 小丑其人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> “为自己的丑恶行径向所有的人报复”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> “再见，伊万，别太记恨我！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 回避型的症结</span></p><span></span><p><span>【2】佐西马长老年轻时候的错误示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> “这是人在打人！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【3】一个信徒的错误示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> “我对具体的人越是憎恨，我对整个人类的爱便越是炽热”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> “爱要力戒弄虚作假”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【4】卡嘉和格露莘卡的错误示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> 两位戏剧女主角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> &nbsp;“我要永远爱您，我要拯救您挣脱自我……”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> “我特别喜欢我五年里流的眼泪……”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【5】爱的正确示范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> “如果我真的对新生的叶片还有感情的话，我只会在怀念你的时候爱它们”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> “爱是诲人不倦的，要辛勤工作，非朝夕之功”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> “每一个个别的人都应该对世上所有的人、也对任何一个个别的人负责”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 一个葱头</span></p><span></span><p><span>【6】尾声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> “我们首先将是善良的，这一点最要紧，然后是正直的，然后——我们将彼此永不相忘”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltb6qN7egTlX9Xoad9d07mE2kgha.m4a" length="34995688" type="audio/mp4"/>
