  <item>
    <title>EP05《专业的力量》：结构化实操指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ba0babdb5e6d6bf9c01fb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ba0babdb5e6d6bf9c01fb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 13:18:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>与其焦虑核心竞争力，不如先学职场三板斧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目以结构化能力为核心，详细叙述了结构化的好处、实操方法，并基于《专业的力量：在自己的领域成为专家》一书，围绕工作当中的四项基本能力进行了阐述。</span></p><span></span><p><span>职场如战场，让自己的成长，跑得过时间。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 核心竞争力的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作的四项基本能力——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 逻辑与框架能力（结构化的能力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 归纳推理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 相互独立，完全穷尽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 自上而下和自下而上的思考方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 演绎推理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 四象限分析、流程分析、要素分析</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何训练结构化能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 讲依据的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 对标的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> 价值输出能力</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhrfXWAOcap29Gskn-Q2SGgvA6Zu.m4a" length="40275447" type="audio/mp4"/>
