  <item>
    <title>EP04《清醒地活》：自洽是一种怎样的状态？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666ed4d8b6a8412729218116</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666ed4d8b6a8412729218116</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 12:04:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>它是</span><strong><span>烦恼、压力、纠结、痛苦</span></strong><span>的一味良药</span></p><span></span><p><span>是保持</span><strong><span>开放、愉快、能量充沛</span></strong><span>的答案之书</span></p><span></span><p><span>是游离内卷与躺平之外的</span><strong><span>体验派人生法则</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>今天带来的这本书叫《清醒地活：超越自我的生命之旅》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> 正念冥想的定义和作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 元认知：认知的认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 脑海中的声音是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 感受：客观世界的主观表述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 我是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a> 能量，与所谓的气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 能量阻塞的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 如何保持能量的流动：允许一切发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 体验式人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 偈子：本来无一物，何处惹尘埃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> 超越自己，亲历生活</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrtnboxkfYBoNX2qfy4S6Uvx9IXL.m4a" length="26339143" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:08</itunes:duration>
